{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":143,"count":42,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-12\",\"游泳\",\"游泳\",\"游泳\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"天氣好熱，我們去游泳，好不好？","pinyin":"Tiānqì hǎo rè, wǒmen qù yóuyǒng, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"The weather is so hot. How about we go swimming?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-12","sourceFront":"游泳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我不會游泳，你會嗎？","pinyin":"Wǒ bú huì yóuyǒng, nǐ huì ma?","english":"I can not swim, can you?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-13","sourceFront":"會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我會游泳，可是游得不太好。","pinyin":"Wǒ huì yóuyǒng, kěshì yóu de bú tài hǎo.","english":"I can swim, but not very well.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我不會游泳。宜文，妳會游泳嗎？","pinyin":"Wǒ bú huì yóuyǒng. Yíwén, nǐ huì yóuyǒng ma?","english":"I can not swim. Yiwen, can you swim?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，海邊的風景也很漂亮，我想去游泳，妳們想去嗎？","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, hǎibiān de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliàng, wǒ xiǎng qù yóuyǒng, nǐmen xiǎng qù ma?","english":"The weather is pretty good today, so is the view at the beach. I want to go swimming. Do you want to go?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我的興趣是運動，打網球、游泳，我都喜歡。","pinyin":"Wǒ de xìngqù shì yùndòng, dǎ wǎngqiú, yóuyǒng, wǒ dōu xǐhuān.","english":"My hobby is doing exercise. I like both tennis and swimming.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-01","sourceFront":"興趣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"游(swim) + 泳(swim) → 'swim-swim': 游泳 means to swim."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-2-12\",\"分鐘\",\"分鐘\",\"分钟\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"十分鐘以前我給他打了一個電話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-12","sourceFront":"分鐘","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他在跟家人談事情，已經講了三十分鐘的話了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-04","sourceFront":"講話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"念了一個小時的書以後，你最好休息十分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-28","sourceFront":"念書","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利商店不遠，從我家過去只要五分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-44","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫生建議這個病人每天跑步三十分鐘，這樣體力、精神就會越來越好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-14","sourceFront":"建議","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫生建議這個病人每天跑步三十分鐘，這樣體力、精神就會越來越好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-15","sourceFront":"病人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們的中文課一節是五十分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-16","sourceFront":"節","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李進公司的頭三個月，每天上班要花兩個小時，後來搬到公司附近，走路十分鐘就到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-18","sourceFront":"頭","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們爬山爬到一半就起風了，過了幾分鐘就下起大雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-23","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種麵不必煮，只要倒進熱水、泡幾分鐘，就可以吃了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-07","sourceFront":"泡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的頭部被棒球打中並當場昏迷，還好幾分鐘後就醒過來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-06","sourceFront":"昏迷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"分(divide) + 鐘(clock) → the clock's divisions are minutes."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-14\",\"小學\",\"小學\",\"小学\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我弟弟是小學四年級的學生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-17","sourceFront":"年級","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們從小學到大學都是同學，也是很好的朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-16","sourceFront":"大學","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這些帶子是我小學的記錄，我請朋友把它存進電腦裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-19","sourceFront":"帶子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前我的小學老師總是親切地教導我們，讓我到現在還是很懷念她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-08","sourceFront":"懷念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的小學教導孩子從平常生活中學習遵守規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-10","sourceFront":"遵守","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"小(small) + 學(learn) → the small, first stage of learning: 小學 is elementary school."},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-31\",\"押金\",\"押金\",\"押金\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-1-31\",\"別\",\"別\",\"别\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我記得有羊、馬、兔子……，最特別的是龍。（打開課本）妳看看……","pinyin":"Wǒ jìdé yǒu yáng, mǎ, tùzi..., zuì tèbié de shì lóng. (dǎkāi kèběn) Nǐ kànkan...","english":"I remember there are goats, horses, rabbits..., and the most special one is the dragon. (Open the textbook) You see...","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"別的時間可以嗎？","pinyin":"Biéde shíjiān kěyǐ ma?","english":"Can you swap the time?","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我朋友最近比較忙，別的時間他沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ péngyǒu zuìjìn bǐjiào máng, biéde shíjiān tā méi yǒukòng.","english":"My friend is busier lately; he isn’t available at other times.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) calls out as a 刂(knife) slices the loaf → time to 別(separate)."},{"key":"[\"B2L06-2-20\",\"选择\",\"選擇\",\"选择\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"去KTV辦活動，是一個不錯的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-20","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你畢業後要出國留學或是留在國內工作，都是不錯的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-17","sourceFront":"國內","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"畢業後要工作還是要繼續念書，我得好好地想想再選擇！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-07","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"筆電的價格和功能，都會影響顧客的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-27","sourceFront":"影響","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"越來越多人選擇上網購物，有的是為了節省時間，有的是因為比價很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-17","sourceFront":"節省","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的生產部門這個月規劃了員工旅遊，有三個不同地點讓大家選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-02","sourceFront":"規劃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快時尚的概念，就是在短時間內提供各式各樣的流行商品，讓顧客有更多更好的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-21","sourceFront":"概念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家超市蔬菜水果的種類很多，可提供民眾較多的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-15","sourceFront":"種類","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，上網訂好火車票後，可選擇到車站或便利商店取票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-21","sourceFront":"取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大型體育活動常選擇在都市舉行，主要原因是交通方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-07","sourceFront":"大型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自己做的肥皂用起來比較安心，也能選擇自己喜歡的氣味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-37","sourceFront":"肥皂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-11\",\"作文\",\"作文\",\"作文\",\"N/Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我不喜歡作文，因為我常常不知道要寫什麼。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-11","sourceFront":"作文","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個週末我得寫一篇五百字的作文。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-10","sourceFront":"篇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這篇作文明天得交給老師，今天晚上一定得寫完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-22","sourceFront":"交","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這篇作文的錯字太多了，所以分數不高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-13","sourceFront":"錯字","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"老師的要求很多，要寫五篇報告、三篇作文，怎麼寫得完？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-02","sourceFront":"要求","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我把這篇作文修改好了，明天就可以交給老師了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-03","sourceFront":"修改","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天的作業是寫一篇作文，可是我的腦子空空的，一個字也寫不出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-12","sourceFront":"空","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次文學比賽，我參加的項目是作文。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-07","sourceFront":"項目","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-2-03\",\"種\",\"種\",\"种\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這種飲料很好喝。","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng yǐnliào hěn hǎohē.","english":"This kind of beverage tastes good.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-19","sourceFront":"好喝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A：這種蛋糕很貴嗎？ B：是啊，這種蛋糕不便宜。","pinyin":"A: Zhè zhǒng dàngāo hěn guì ma? B: Shì ā, zhè zhǒng dàngāo bù piányí.","english":"A: Is this kind of cake expensive? B: Yes, this kind of cake is not cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-12","sourceFront":"便宜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A：你要哪種筆？ B：我要鉛筆。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ yào nǎ zhǒng bǐ? B: Wǒ yào qiānbǐ.","english":"A: What kind of pen do you want? B: I want a pencil.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-04","sourceFront":"鉛筆","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你喜歡喝哪種茶？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān hē nǎ zhǒng chá?","english":"What kind of tea do you like?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-03","sourceFront":"種","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們下個星期要學第十五課，我剛才先看了一點兒，書上有很多種動物，我覺得很有意思。","pinyin":"Wǒmen xià ge xīngqí yào xué dì shíwǔ kè, wǒ gāngcái xiān kàn le yìdiǎnr, shū shàng yǒu hěn duō zhǒng dòngwù, wǒ juéde hěn yǒuyìsi.","english":"We are going to learn lesson fifteen next week. I previewed a bit earlier just now. There are many kinds of animals in the book; I think it is very interesting.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"華人用不一樣的動物代表每一年，一共有十二種動物。","pinyin":"Huárén yòng bù yíyàng de dòngwù dàibiǎo měi yì nián, yígòng yǒu shí'èr zhǒng dòngwù.","english":"Chinese use different animals to represent each year, and there are a total of twelve kinds of animals.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有啊！他們有很多種冰淇淋。","pinyin":"Yǒu a! Tāmen yǒu hěn duō zhǒng bīngqílín.","english":"Oh, yeah. They have lots of kinds of ice cream.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他們賣很多種飲料。","pinyin":"Tāmen mài hěn duō zhǒng yǐnliào.","english":"They have various kinds of drink.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這種小鉛筆怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎo qiānbǐ zěnmeyàng?","english":"What do you think about this type of small pencil?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 禾(grain) holds a 重(heavy) load → every single 種(kind)."},{"key":"[\"B2L13-1-06\",\"功能\",\"功能\",\"功能\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請你說明一下，這些產品的功能有什麼差別？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-06","sourceFront":"功能","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"平板越輕、功能越多，價格就越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-08","sourceFront":"價格","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我認為跟平板比起來，筆電的功能比較好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-07","sourceFront":"比","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"店員把筆電的功能說明得很清楚，所以客人都明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-17","sourceFront":"明白","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"筆電的價格和功能，都會影響顧客的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-27","sourceFront":"影響","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理說，我們要一邊說笑話一邊介紹機器的功能，這樣子才賣得好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-14","sourceFront":"這樣子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩部筆電的功能差異不大，就是價錢差了幾百塊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-20","sourceFront":"差異","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這支手機的照相功能很強，拍出來的效果比照相機還要好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-28","sourceFront":"效果","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在的電腦處理資料的速度比以往快得多，功能也更多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-11","sourceFront":"以往","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著科技越來越進步，手機的功能也越來越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4