白做人、做事的道理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-26","sourceFront":"做人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個平板的使用說明寫得很詳細，客人自己看就能明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-10","sourceFront":"詳細","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"青少年常因為不了解而誤會父母的教育方式，或許等他們長大了，就能真正明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-24","sourceFront":"真正","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他畢竟是個小孩子，還不懂做人做事的道理，等他長大就會明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-19","sourceFront":"畢竟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時候孩子不明白自己到底犯了什麼錯，父母應該好好跟他們溝通。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-10","sourceFront":"犯錯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-13\",\"洋裝\",\"洋裝\",\"洋装\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"陳小姐今天穿了一件跟我相同牌子的洋裝，還好顏色不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-21","sourceFront":"相同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我今天跟同學穿了樣式不同，但是顏色相同的洋裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-06","sourceFront":"樣式","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"客人看了那件洋裝一眼就走了，應該不喜歡吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-08","sourceFront":"眼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 洋(sea) and 裝(dress): 洋裝 means dress."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-2-08\",\"閱讀\",\"閱讀\",\"阅读\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"多閱讀書報、雜誌，能讓我們的知識更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-08","sourceFront":"閱讀","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"歐先生有閱讀的障礙，就算一篇極短的文章，讀起來也覺得很困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-25","sourceFront":"障礙","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只要照溫老師安排的課程，多閱讀、多練習，你的中文就會有很大的進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-03","sourceFront":"進步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小張喜歡閱讀法國的文學作品，透過這些作品，讓他了解了法國文化的特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-15","sourceFront":"文學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這些跟卡通人物有關書籍，很適合兒童閱讀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-17","sourceFront":"書籍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小王的閱讀報告寫得很精彩，連教授都在課堂上當面誇獎他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-44","sourceFront":"誇獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對我來說，閱讀醫學系列的小說是一個很好的休閒活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-04","sourceFront":"系列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 閱(examine) and 讀(study): 閱讀 means read."},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-21\",\"不滿\",\"不滿\",\"不满\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有一些家長對現在的升學制度不滿，認為學校不應該逼孩子寫那麼多測驗題目。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-28","sourceFront":"制度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"老師不滿意我們這一組的報告，要我們重做一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-55","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本地社區的房子常被好奇的觀光客破壞，令人們十分不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-09","sourceFront":"好奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Clearly 不(not) possessing 滿(full): 不滿 means dissatisfy, dissatisfied."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-26\",\"以免\",\"以免\",\"以免\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這條路不平，有民眾貼了海報，請大家走路時要小心，以免受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-26","sourceFront":"以免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"收到帳單的時候得準時去繳費，以免超過時間後得繳更多錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-28","sourceFront":"帳單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到別人家做客時不能太隨便，以免發生不愉快的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-07","sourceFront":"做客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"廚師們都會好好保養他們的用具，以免影響做菜的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-17","sourceFront":"用具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"工廠排水系統得設計好，以免汙染自然環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-48","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上臺報告以前要把資料準備好，以免到時候手忙腳亂的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-37","sourceFront":"上臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爬山時如果碰到大雨就應避免繼續前進，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前進","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車時萬一發生車禍，千萬要冷靜，以免情況更嚴重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-60","sourceFront":"千萬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他手上有傷，醫師建議他三日以內不要碰水，以免感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-37","sourceFront":"傷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車時千萬別把頭探出車窗外，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-02","sourceFront":"探","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"申請簽證的表格請填完整資料，以免無法順利申請。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-21","sourceFront":"完整","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 以(according to) and 免(spare): 以免 means lest, in order to avoid."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-10\",\"角度\",\"角度\",\"角度\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個模特兒個子高、長得美，從什麼角度拍都漂亮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-10","sourceFront":"角度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"由於每個人看事情的角度不同，所以得溝通才能避免誤會","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-10","sourceFront":"角度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"用人類的角度去看大自然， 就看不出大自然的本來價值。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-11","sourceFront":"本來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 角(angle) and 度(degree): 角度 means point of view."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-18\",\"普遍\",\"普遍\",\"普遍\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"夏天時，在臺灣、日本、菲律賓都有颱風，這是很普遍的現象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-18","sourceFront":"普遍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"雖然現在網路很普遍了，還是有不少人喜歡聽電臺的節目。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-25","sourceFront":"電臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 普(widespread) and 遍(everywhere): 普遍 means widespread, common."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-22\",\"工業\",\"工業\",\"工业\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"許多國家因為工業進步得太快，反而使得農業慢慢不被重視了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-22","sourceFront":"工業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"不論是工業或家庭廢水，對人們的健康都有不好的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-44","sourceFront":"廢水","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了發展工業而不斷開發，這樣下去森林早晚會被破壞光的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-10","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"使用高度技術製造出來的工業生產機器，操作起來往往更有效率。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-25","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 工(labor) and 業(business): 工業 means industry."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-23\",\"回信\",\"回信\",\"回信\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"收到別人的信時，應該回信告訴對方收到了，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-23","sourceFront":"回信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-2-28\",\"最多\",\"最多\",\"最多\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在臺灣鐵路局的網站訂票，一人最多只能訂六張搭車當天的票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-28","sourceFront":"最多","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-2-17\",\"仓库\",\"倉庫\",\"仓库\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小王對農業很有興趣，家裡的倉庫擺滿了種田用的工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-17","sourceFront":"倉庫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-23\",\"燙\",\"燙\",\"烫\",\"Vs/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"火鍋(hotpot)剛煮好時很燙，吃的時候小心點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-23","sourceFront":"燙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"白天沙漠裡的沙子很燙(to be scalded)，要是光著腳，一定會被燙傷的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-27","sourceFront":"沙子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-31\",\"濃\",\"濃\",\"浓\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"很濃的茶跟很濃的咖啡一樣，都會讓人睡不著覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-31","sourceFront":"濃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他沖咖啡的技術很好，香味總是比別人沖的濃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-14","sourceFront":"沖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-01\",\"茶飲\",\"茶飲\",\"茶饮\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家便利商店現在有「咖啡、茶飲買一送一」的優惠活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-01","sourceFront":"茶飲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-21\",\"夏季\",\"夏季\",\"夏季\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我國四季都有美麗的風景：春季時平原有花海、夏季時海灘有日出、秋季時山區有紅樹、冬季時高山有白雪，都十分迷人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-23","sourceFront":"四季","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-49\",\"下棋\",\"下棋\",\"下棋\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我常跟電腦下棋，因為想玩就玩，不必擔心時間早晚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-49","sourceFront":"下棋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-50\",\"条\",\"條\",\"条\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"妳看，這條黃色的褲子不錯吧？","pinyin":"Nǐ kàn, zhè tiáo huángsè de kùzi búcuò ba?","english":"Look! This pair of yellow pants is nice, isn’t it?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很好看。這條藍的也很漂亮，藍色是今年很流行的顏色。","pinyin":"Hěn hǎokàn. Zhè tiáo lán de yě hěn piàoliang, lánsè shì jīnnián hěn liúxíng de yánsè.","english":"It is. This pair of blue pants is beautiful too. Blue is a popular color of this year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這兩條我都去穿穿看。","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiáo wǒ dōu qù chuānchuān kàn.","english":"I will try both on.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"元真，妳的這條裙子真好看，我很喜歡。","pinyin":"Yuánzhēn, nǐ de zhè tiáo qúnzi zhēn hǎokàn, wǒ hěn xǐhuān.","english":"Yuanzhen, your skirt is very beautiful; I like it very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我家附近有三條捷運線，一條紅的、一條綠的和一條藍的。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn yǒu sān tiáo jiéyùn xiàn, yì tiáo hóng de, yì tiáo lǜ de hé yì tiáo lán de.","english":"There are three MRT routes near my place; the red one, the green one and the blue one.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-2-02\",\"探\",\"探\",\"探\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"開車時千萬別把頭探出車窗外，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-02","sourceFront":"探","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他現在的身體狀況很糟，請暫時先別去探他的病。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-01","sourceFront":"探病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-2-03\",\"化装\",\"化裝\",\"化装\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次活動大家都化裝參加，要是你碰見我大概認不出我是誰。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-03","sourceFront":"化裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"化裝舞會上他打扮成一具機器人，連說話走路都模仿機器人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-11","sourceFront":"具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-2-15\",\"竟然\",\"竟然\",\"竟然\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次會議的效率真差，有人竟然沒看資料就來了，真是誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-15","sourceFront":"竟然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-14\",\"大都\",\"大都\",\"大都\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"由於網路發達，現代人大都習慣上網購物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-14","sourceFront":"大都","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在大都市，早上起床能聽見鳥叫聲，那真是太難得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-36","sourceFront":"聲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"任\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"An honorable 亻(person) balances a heavy burden upon a sturdy carrying 壬(pole), earning lasting 任(trust)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"僻\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 亻(person) who lives by the 辟(law) of the far woods stays out-of-the-way → 僻(out-of-the-way)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"接電話\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"接(connect) + 電(electricity) + 話(talk) → connecting the electric talk: answering the phone."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"書包\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 書(book) and 包(pack): 書包 means schoolbag."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"系\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A guiding stroke 丿(slash) organizes tangled strands of fine 糸(silk) into an orderly 系(system)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"紅色\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"紅(red) + 色(color) → the color red: 紅色(red)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"蟻\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A crawling 虫(insect) carrying crumbs in a colony: 蟻(ant)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"越南\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"越(Yue people) + 南(south) → the southern Yue land, Vietnam."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"附近\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"附(close) + 近(near) = 附近: the vicinity, what's close around you."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"電\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 雨(rain) takes a 日(sun) flash → crackling 電(electricity)."}]}
